    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>Play for free!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217330/extras/cb1efa5cfd7f8035f47b5f8e79a91e3d.poster.avif?t=1714964982\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217330/extras/cb1efa5cfd7f8035f47b5f8e79a91e3d.webm?t=1714964982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217330/extras/cb1efa5cfd7f8035f47b5f8e79a91e3d.mp4?t=1714964982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Terminal squad: swarmites is a game with indirect control where you must erect a chain of buildings, which generate resources for construction or the combat units for destruction of an enemy. The key to the victory is a smart sequence of actions and keeping of a balance between the erection of combat, defensive and manufacturing facilities.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A base as a single entity<br></li><li>Fight against an infinite flow of enemies through erection of a chain of buildings<br></li><li>Random level modifiers strengthen your enemy<br></li><li>Use the skills and the explorations in the proper moment in order to gain a tactical superiority<br></li><li>Adjust an energy flow to the buildings through their connection and disconnection in order to increase or decrease the rate of production or defence at a certain part of chain.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217330/extras/cb1efa5cfd7f8035f47b5f8e79a91e3d.poster.avif?t=1714964982\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217330/extras/cb1efa5cfd7f8035f47b5f8e79a91e3d.webm?t=1714964982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217330/extras/cb1efa5cfd7f8035f47b5f8e79a91e3d.mp4?t=1714964982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Terminal squad: swarmites is a game with indirect control where you must erect a chain of buildings, which generate resources for construction or the combat units for destruction of an enemy. The key to the victory is a smart sequence of actions and keeping of a balance between the erection of combat, defensive and manufacturing facilities.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A base as a single entity<br></li><li>Fight against an infinite flow of enemies through erection of a chain of buildings<br></li><li>Random level modifiers strengthen your enemy<br></li><li>Use the skills and the explorations in the proper moment in order to gain a tactical superiority<br></li><li>Adjust an energy flow to the buildings through their connection and disconnection in order to increase or decrease the rate of production or defence at a certain part of chain.</li></ul>",
